    "rationale": "Manual validation only; scripts were not runnable in this environment. Present paths already permit untrusted third-party MCP definitions or outputs to reach S3 sinks: restricted local file reads followed by external note sync, and untrusted notes output followed by Slack posting to externally shared channels. The only declared approval control is remembered first-call approval, which is not wired as a true per-call gate and does not materially reduce current path risk. The most important decaying or absent control is definition pinning and review for quicknotes_mcp; without it, supply-chain poisoning directly creates goal-hijack and exfiltration paths."
